boxes, and sell them by placing them on your shelves. Choose a unique name for your store. Create the perfect store for collectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039100/extras/1b072d3827e661ca105cff56450cc516.avif?t=1761568105\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your collection with rare and valuable warrior figures from surprise boxes. You can earn money by selling these figures or complete your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039100/extras/4a59a021aa8371a5c9e32b2bd1186e34.avif?t=1761568105\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your store and attract more customers! Gain new customers and increase your profits with new shelves, race platforms, and figure boxes.</p>",
